[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817847840","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105602#issuecomment-2817847840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105602","id":2817847840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n9PIg","user":{"login":"NatGazer","id":67602607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjAyNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67602607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer","html_url":"https://github.com/NatGazer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NatGazer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T07:35:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T07:35:39Z","body":"Also reproducible in:\n\nv4.5.dev2.official [af2c71397]\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\nv4.2.stable.official [46dc27791]\nv4.0.4.stable.official [fc0b241c9]\nv3.6.stable.official [de2f0f147]\n\nThe bug is not present in **Godot 2.1.6** for big values (Godot 2.1.6 doesn't support INF)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4509c597-656a-454a-ae44-75356c2bef0a)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817847840/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825184557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105602#issuecomment-2825184557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105602","id":2825184557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oZOUt","user":{"login":"ASamBlur","id":199510196,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-RItA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199510196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur","html_url":"https://github.com/ASamBlur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T18:39:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T18:39:33Z","body":"I tried looking into it and it seems to be an issue with the Range class:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/063fdaf7-d8b0-441d-8a0b-04d177d8d340)\n(max value is the default and step is 1)\n\nIt's likely an issue with how calculations are made using the min value, which originates from:\n\n\tif (shared->step > 0) {\n\t\tp_val = Math::round((p_val - shared->min) / shared->step) * shared->step + shared->min;\n\t}\n(https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9f03bbf9086a1164490cd7cb4e8dd056bf57eac2/scene/gui/range.cpp#L141C1-L145C1)\nIt was changed in #65101\n\nAdditionally, the calculation in the method get_as_ratio() might also cause problems (as seen for slider and progressbar in the example shown above)\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0ed1c192e87e107f507d41dae00f9859bcc45ef1/scene/gui/range.cpp#L284C1-L287C3","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825184557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]